true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-nan023-print-consort","subject_person_id":"c03_362_4d7","object_person_id":"qc9_jnl_cpw","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"元顯納妾","nan023_print_reading":"consort","source_partnership_role":"妾"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd1739","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000","quote":"王誕字茂世太保弘從祖兄也祖恬晉中軍將軍父混太常卿誕少有才藻晉孝武帝崩從叔尚書令珣為哀策出本示誕曰猶恨少序節物誕攬筆便益之接其秋冬代變後云霜繁廣除風回高殿珣歎美因而用之襲爵雉鄉侯為會稽王世子元顯後軍長史琅邪內史誕結事元顯嬖人張法順故見寵元顯納妾誕為之親迎隨府轉驃騎長史內史如故元顯討桓𤣥欲悉誅諸桓誕救桓修等由此得免修誕甥也及𤣥得志將見誅修為陳請乃徙廣州","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0117","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0120"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"王誕代迎，元顯納妾。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-song052-wangdan-consort","subject_person_id":"qc9_jnl_cpw","object_person_id":"c03_362_4d7","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"元顯納妾","song052_wangdan_reading":"consort","source_partnership_role":"妾"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-wangdan-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003","quote":"隆安四年，會稽王世子元顯開後軍府，又以誕補功曹。尋除尚書吏部郎，仍為後軍長史，領廬江太守，加鎮蠻護軍。轉龍驤將軍、琅邪內史，長史如故。誕結事元顯嬖人張法順，故為元顯所寵。元顯納妾，誕為之親迎。隨府轉驃騎長史，將軍、內史如故。元顯討桓玄，欲悉誅桓氏，誕固陳脩等與玄志趣不同，由此得免。脩，誕甥也。及玄得志，誕將見誅，脩為之陳請，又言脩等得免之由，乃徙誕廣州。盧循據廣州，以誕為其平南府長史，甚賓禮之。誕久客思歸，乃說循曰：「下官流遠在此，被蒙殊眷，士感知己，實思報答。本非戎旅，在此無用。素為劉鎮軍所識，情味不淺，若得北歸，必蒙任寄，公私際會，思報厚恩，愈於停此，空移歲月。」循甚然之。時廣州刺史吳隱之亦為循所拘留，誕又曰：「將軍今留吳公，公私非計。孫伯符豈不欲留華子魚，但以一境不容二君耳。」於是誕及隱之並得還。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0088","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0085"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"主婚者元顯，代迎者王誕。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0120","surface":"妾","start":120,"end":121,"person_id":"qc9_jnl_cpw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0088","surface":"妾","start":88,"end":89,"person_id":"qc9_jnl_cpw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-nan023-print-consort","subject_person_id":"c03_362_4d7","object_person_id":"qc9_jnl_cpw","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"元顯納妾","nan023_print_reading":"consort","source_partnership_role":"妾"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd1739","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000","quote":"王誕字茂世太保弘從祖兄也祖恬晉中軍將軍父混太常卿誕少有才藻晉孝武帝崩從叔尚書令珣為哀策出本示誕曰猶恨少序節物誕攬筆便益之接其秋冬代變後云霜繁廣除風回高殿珣歎美因而用之襲爵雉鄉侯為會稽王世子元顯後軍長史琅邪內史誕結事元顯嬖人張法順故見寵元顯納妾誕為之親迎隨府轉驃騎長史內史如故元顯討桓𤣥欲悉誅諸桓誕救桓修等由此得免修誕甥也及𤣥得志將見誅修為陳請乃徙廣州","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0117","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0120"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"王誕代迎，元顯納妾。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-song052-wangdan-consort","subject_person_id":"qc9_jnl_cpw","objec