轉驃騎長史，將軍、內史如故。元顯討桓玄，欲悉誅桓氏，誕固陳脩等與玄志趣不同，由此得免。脩，誕甥也。及玄得志，誕將見誅，脩為之陳請，又言脩等得免之由，乃徙誕廣州。盧循據廣州，以誕為其平南府長史，甚賓禮之。誕久客思歸，乃說循曰：「下官流遠在此，被蒙殊眷，士感知己，實思報答。本非戎旅，在此無用。素為劉鎮軍所識，情味不淺，若得北歸，必蒙任寄，公私際會，思報厚恩，愈於停此，空移歲月。」循甚然之。時廣州刺史吳隱之亦為循所拘留，誕又曰：「將軍今留吳公，公私非計。孫伯符豈不欲留華子魚，但以一境不容二君耳。」於是誕及隱之並得還。","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0010","surface":"元顯","start":10,"end":12,"person_id":"c03_362_4d7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0019","surface":"誕","start":19,"end":20,"person_id":"vhf_729_g6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0067","surface":"誕","start":67,"end":68,"person_id":"vhf_729_g6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0070","surface":"元顯","start":70,"end":72,"person_id":"c03_362_4d7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0074","surface":"張法順","start":74,"end":77,"person_id":"xee_hex_u4o","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0080","surface":"元顯","start":80,"end":82,"person_id":"c03_362_4d7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0085","surface":"元顯","start":85,"end":87,"person_id":"c03_362_4d7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0088","surface":"妾","start":88,"end":89,"person_id":"qc9_jnl_cpw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0090","surface":"誕","start":90,"end":91,"person_id":"vhf_729_g6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p003:m0112","surfac